# Payment Strategy Implementation Plan

**Goal**: Implement "Direct-to-Merchant" payment model.
**Strategy**:
1.  Remove platform service fees (Spendigo does not take a cut per order).
2.  Offer two payment options:
    -   **Pay at Store / On Delivery** (Cash/Interac) - No fees for anyone.
    -   **Pay Online** (Stripe) - Processed directly by merchant (mocked/prepared).

## Proposed Changes

### 1. [MODIFY] [OrderContext.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx)
-   Update [Order](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#22-37) interface:
    -   Add `paymentMethod`: `'card' | 'in_store'`.
    -   Add `paymentStatus`: `'paid' | 'pending'`.
-   Update [addOrder](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#169-193) function to accept these new fields.

### 2. [MODIFY] [Checkout.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Checkout.tsx)
-   **Remove Service Fee**: Delete the `$2.00` fee calculation.
-   **Payment Selection UI**:
    -   Add Radio/Selection for "Pay Now (Card)" vs "Pay at Store / Door".
    -   "Pay at Store" message: "Save fees by paying with Cash or Debit upon receipt."
    -   "Pay Now" message: "Payment processed securely by [Store Name]." (Mocked Stripe).
-   **Submit Logic**:
    -   Pass selected payment method to [addOrder](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#169-193) (via [useOrders](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#247-252) or however it is called - currently Checkout uses [useCart](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/CartContext.tsx#214-219) but needs [addOrder](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#169-193)). Note: [Checkout.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Checkout.tsx) currently calls [clearCart](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/CartContext.tsx#191-192) but doesn't actually call [addOrder](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#169-193) from context?
    -   *Correction*: [Checkout.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Checkout.tsx) in the view I saw calls [handlePayment](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Checkout.tsx#23-28) which just alerts. I need to make it call [addOrder](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#169-193) from [OrderContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#46-57) to actually save the order! The previous task fixed order routing via [OrderContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#46-57), so [Checkout](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Checkout.tsx#6-138) *must* use it.

### 3. [MODIFY] [MerchantOrders.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/merchant/Orders.tsx)
-   Update [Order](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#22-37) interface to match Context.
-   **UI Updates**:
    -   Show `paymentMethod` icon/text on Order Card.
    -   If `in_store`, add a visual cue (e.g., "Collect Payment" badge).
    -   If `card`, show "Paid".

## Verification Plan
1.  **Consumer**: Place an order with "Pay at Store".
    -   Verify Total is correct (no service fee).
    -   Verify Checkout completes.
2.  **Merchant**: View the order.
    -   Verify it says "Pay at Store" and status is "Pending Payment" (or similar).
3.  **Consumer**: Place an order with "Pay Online".
    -   Verify it says "Paid".
